@lang en
IMPORT `bvvcx-p1-definitions`

-- Named cases for the tests. No rules and no directives: every figure here is a scenario
-- value, chosen by the test author, not a figure from the Rules. The expected answers live
-- in the tests modules, each worked by hand from the source text.
--
-- THE STANDARD CASE. A used 5-seat passenger car, made 2021, first registered January 2022,
-- worth 600,000,000 VND when the contract was concluded on 28 December 2025; insured at
-- value (sum insured 600,000,000) for 1 January to 31 December 2026, premium 3,650,000 paid
-- in full on 28 December 2025; no deductible on the certificate; no supplementary clause.
-- On 15 June 2026 in Vietnam, a sudden collision, the purchaser's consenting, licensed and
-- sober friend driving; the insurer told after 1 hour, written notice after 2 days. Market
-- value at the time and place of the loss 580,000,000. Time in use when the insurance began:
-- January 2022 to January 2026 = 48 months, so depreciation is 15%.

§ `Fixtures`

§§ `The vehicle`

`the standard vehicle` MEANS `The insured vehicle` WITH
    `kind`                                                    IS `a self-propelled vehicle of a kind the TCVN standard lists`
    `year of manufacture`                                     IS 2021
    `month of first registration`                             IS JUST (`A calendar month` WITH `year` IS 2022, `month` IS 1)
    `brand new when the contract was concluded`               IS FALSE
    `price published by the maker in Vietnam, or import price with all taxes` IS NOTHING
    `market value when the contract was concluded`            IS JUST 600_000_000
    `designed to carry`                                       IS `passengers`
    `permitted load`                                          IS 500
    `permitted number of persons`                             IS 5

GIVEN `the registration month` IS A MAYBE `A calendar month`
      `the year made`          IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `The insured vehicle`
`a used car worth 600 million, registered` `the registration month` `, made in` `the year made` MEANS
    `The insured vehicle` WITH
        `kind`                                                    IS `a self-propelled vehicle of a kind the TCVN standard lists`
        `year of manufacture`                                     IS `the year made`
        `month of first registration`                             IS `the registration month`
        `brand new when the contract was concluded`               IS FALSE
        `price published by the maker in Vietnam, or import price with all taxes` IS NOTHING
        `market value when the contract was concluded`            IS JUST 600_000_000
        `designed to carry`                                       IS `passengers`
        `permitted load`                                          IS 500
        `permitted number of persons`                             IS 5

GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `the month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `A calendar month`
`registered in` `the year` `,` `the month` MEANS
    JUST (`A calendar month` WITH `year` IS `the year`, `month` IS `the month`)

GIVEN `the permitted load` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `The insured vehicle`
`a goods vehicle permitted to carry` `the permitted load` MEANS
    `The insured vehicle` WITH
        `kind`                                                    IS `a self-propelled vehicle of a kind the TCVN standard lists`
        `year of manufacture`                                     IS 2021
        `month of first registration`                             IS JUST (`A calendar month` WITH `year` IS 2022, `month` IS 1)
        `brand new when the contract was concluded`               IS FALSE
        `price published by the maker in Vietnam, or import price with all taxes` IS NOTHING
        `market value when the contract was concluded`            IS JUST 600_000_000
        `designed to carry`                                       IS `goods`
        `permitted load`                                          IS `the permitted load`
        `permitted number of persons`                             IS 2

`a two-wheeled motorcycle` MEANS `The insured vehicle` WITH
    `kind`                                                    IS `a two-wheeled motorcycle`
    `year of manufacture`                                     IS 2021
    `month of first registration`                             IS JUST (`A calendar month` WITH `year` IS 2022, `month` IS 1)
    `brand new when the contract was concluded`               IS FALSE
    `price published by the maker in Vietnam, or import price with all taxes` IS NOTHING
    `market value when the contract was concluded`            IS JUST 60_000_000
    `designed to carry`                                       IS `passengers`
    `permitted load`                                          IS 0
    `permitted number of persons`                             IS 2

§§ `The policy`

`premium paid in full at conclusion` MEANS `The premium arrangements` WITH
    `the premium`                                              IS 3_650_000
    `the premium paid so far`                                  IS 3_650_000
    `a written agreement on the time for paying the premium`   IS FALSE
    `the date by which the premium was to be paid`             IS YMD 2026 1 1
    `the date the premium was paid in full`                    IS JUST (YMD 2025 12 28)
    `an agreement allowing the purchaser to owe the premium`   IS FALSE
    `the date a written acceptance continues the contract from` IS NOTHING

GIVEN `written agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `due`               IS A DATE
      `paid on`           IS A MAYBE DATE
      `continued from`    IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `The premium arrangements`
`premium arrangements: written agreement` `written agreement` `, due` `due` `, paid in full on` `paid on` `, continued from` `continued from` MEANS
    `The premium arrangements` WITH
        `the premium`                                              IS 3_650_000
        `the premium paid so far`                                  IS (IF isJust `paid on` THEN 3_650_000 ELSE 0)
        `a written agreement on the time for paying the premium`   IS `written agreement`
        `the date by which the premium was to be paid`             IS `due`
        `the date the premium was paid in full`                    IS `paid on`
        `an agreement allowing the purchaser to owe the premium`   IS FALSE
        `the date a written acceptance continues the contract from` IS `continued from`

-- The general policy builder; the standard policy is one call of it.
GIVEN `the sum insured`  IS A NUMBER
      `the deductible`   IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `the clauses`      IS A LIST OF `A supplementary clause`
      `the end`          IS A DATE
      `the arrangements` IS A `The premium arrangements`
      `the notice`       IS A MAYBE `A notice of unilateral termination`
      `the transfer`     IS A MAYBE `A transfer of ownership`
GIVETH A `The policy`
`a 2026 policy: sum insured` `the sum insured` `, deductible` `the deductible` `, clauses` `the clauses` `, ending` `the end` `, premium` `the arrangements` `, notice` `the notice` `, transfer` `the transfer` MEANS
    `The policy` WITH
        `the date the contract was concluded`                     IS YMD 2025 12 28
        `the start of the period of insurance`                    IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `the end of the period of insurance`                      IS `the end`
        `the sum insured`                                         IS `the sum insured`
        `the deductible stated on the certificate`                IS `the deductible`
        `the certificate states reduction rates of its own`       IS FALSE
        `the supplementary clauses on the certificate`            IS `the clauses`
        `a clause agreed under Article 23 is on the certificate`  IS FALSE
        `the car-hire sum insured per day`                        IS JUST 800_000
        `the car-hire sum insured per event`                      IS JUST 8_000_000
        `a contract for a group of vehicles`                      IS FALSE
        `the request form was signed or confirmed electronically` IS TRUE
        `the premium arrangements`                                IS `the arrangements`
        `a notice of unilateral termination`                      IS `the notice`
        `a transfer of ownership`                                 IS `the transfer`

GIVEN `the sum insured` IS A NUMBER
      `the deductible`  IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `the clauses`     IS A LIST OF `A supplementary clause`
GIVETH A `The policy`
`a 2026 policy with sum insured` `the sum insured` `, deductible` `the deductible` `, clauses` `the clauses` MEANS
    `a 2026 policy: sum insured` `the sum insured` `, deductible` `the deductible` `, clauses` `the clauses`
        `, ending` (YMD 2026 12 31) `, premium` `premium paid in full at conclusion` `, notice` NOTHING `, transfer` NOTHING

`the standard policy` MEANS
    `a 2026 policy with sum insured` 600_000_000 `, deductible` NOTHING `, clauses` EMPTY

GIVEN `the clauses` IS A LIST OF `A supplementary clause`
GIVETH A `The policy`
`the standard policy with` `the clauses` MEANS
    `a 2026 policy with sum insured` 600_000_000 `, deductible` NOTHING `, clauses` `the clauses`

GIVEN `the end`     IS A DATE
      `the clauses` IS A LIST OF `A supplementary clause`
GIVETH A `The policy`
`a policy from 1 January 2026 to` `the end` `with` `the clauses` MEANS
    `a 2026 policy: sum insured` 600_000_000 `, deductible` NOTHING `, clauses` `the clauses`
        `, ending` `the end` `, premium` `premium paid in full at conclusion` `, notice` NOTHING `, transfer` NOTHING

`a policy with an Article 23 clause` MEANS `The policy` WITH
    `the date the contract was concluded`                     IS YMD 2025 12 28
    `the start of the period of insurance`                    IS YMD 2026 1 1
    `the end of the period of insurance`                      IS YMD 2026 12 31
    `the sum insured`                                         IS 600_000_000
    `the deductible stated on the certificate`                IS NOTHING
    `the certificate states reduction rates of its own`       IS FALSE
    `the supplementary clauses on the certificate`            IS EMPTY
    `a clause agreed under Article 23 is on the certificate`  IS TRUE
    `the car-hire sum insured per day`                        IS NOTHING
    `the car-hire sum insured per event`                      IS NOTHING
    `a contract for a group of vehicles`                      IS FALSE
    `the request form was signed or confirmed electronically` IS TRUE
    `the premium arrangements`                                IS `premium paid in full at conclusion`
    `a notice of unilateral termination`                      IS NOTHING
    `a transfer of ownership`                                 IS NOTHING

`a policy whose certificate sets its own reduction rates` MEANS `The policy` WITH
    `the date the contract was concluded`                     IS YMD 2025 12 28
    `the start of the period of insurance`                    IS YMD 2026 1 1
    `the end of the period of insurance`                      IS YMD 2026 12 31
    `the sum insured`                                         IS 600_000_000
    `the deductible stated on the certificate`                IS NOTHING
    `the certificate states reduction rates of its own`       IS TRUE
    `the supplementary clauses on the certificate`            IS EMPTY
    `a clause agreed under Article 23 is on the certificate`  IS FALSE
    `the car-hire sum insured per day`                        IS NOTHING
    `the car-hire sum insured per event`                      IS NOTHING
    `a contract for a group of vehicles`                      IS FALSE
    `the request form was signed or confirmed electronically` IS TRUE
    `the premium arrangements`                                IS `premium paid in full at conclusion`
    `a notice of unilateral termination`                      IS NOTHING
    `a transfer of ownership`                                 IS NOTHING

§§ `The damaged parts`

`a door repaired for 8 million` MEANS `A damaged part` WITH
    `description`                                         IS "front door"
    `kind`                                                IS `an ordinary part of the vehicle`
    `cause`                                               IS `the insured event itself`
    `repairable to the maker's technical safety standard` IS TRUE
    `reasonable cost of repair`                           IS 8_000_000
    `actual cost of a new replacement`                    IS 20_000_000

`a bumper replaced for 10 million` MEANS `A damaged part` WITH
    `description`                                         IS "rear bumper"
    `kind`                                                IS `an ordinary part of the vehicle`
    `cause`                                               IS `the insured event itself`
    `repairable to the maker's technical safety standard` IS FALSE
    `reasonable cost of repair`                           IS 0
    `actual cost of a new replacement`                    IS 10_000_000

GIVEN `the description` IS A STRING
      `the kind`        IS A `A kind of part`
      `the cause`       IS A `A cause of damage to a part`
      `the repair cost` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A damaged part`
`a part repaired:` `the description` `, of kind` `the kind` `, caused by` `the cause` `, for` `the repair cost` MEANS
    `A damaged part` WITH
        `description`                                         IS `the description`
        `kind`                                                IS `the kind`
        `cause`                                               IS `the cause`
        `repairable to the maker's technical safety standard` IS TRUE
        `reasonable cost of repair`                           IS `the repair cost`
        `actual cost of a new replacement`                    IS `the repair cost` TIMES 2

GIVEN `the description`      IS A STRING
      `the kind`             IS A `A kind of part`
      `the cause`            IS A `A cause of damage to a part`
      `the replacement cost` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A damaged part`
`a part replaced:` `the description` `, of kind` `the kind` `, caused by` `the cause` `, for` `the replacement cost` MEANS
    `A damaged part` WITH
        `description`                                         IS `the description`
        `kind`                                                IS `the kind`
        `cause`                                               IS `the cause`
        `repairable to the maker's technical safety standard` IS FALSE
        `reasonable cost of repair`                           IS 0
        `actual cost of a new replacement`                    IS `the replacement cost`

`the standard parts` MEANS LIST `a door repaired for 8 million`, `a bumper replaced for 10 million`

§§ `The event`

`a valid inspection certificate` MEANS `The inspection status at the time of the loss` WITH
    `a valid inspection certificate`                                           IS TRUE
    `a new vehicle awaiting its first inspection`                              IS FALSE
    `circulating temporarily with the written approval of the competent authority` IS FALSE
    `in the course of its first registration and inspection in Vietnam`        IS FALSE

GIVEN `valid`           IS A BOOLEAN
      `new and waiting` IS A BOOLEAN
      `temporary`       IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The inspection status at the time of the loss`
`inspection: valid` `valid` `, new and awaiting inspection` `new and waiting` `, circulating temporarily` `temporary` MEANS
    `The inspection status at the time of the loss` WITH
        `a valid inspection certificate`                                           IS `valid`
        `a new vehicle awaiting its first inspection`                              IS `new and waiting`
        `circulating temporarily with the written approval of the competent authority` IS `temporary`
        `in the course of its first registration and inspection in Vietnam`        IS FALSE

GIVEN `the load`     IS A NUMBER
      `the persons`  IS A NUMBER
      `the children` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The load at the time of the loss`
`carrying` `the load` `, with persons` `the persons` `, and children under 7` `the children` MEANS
    `The load at the time of the loss` WITH
        `load carried or towed`                         IS `the load`
        `persons carried, other than children under 7`  IS `the persons`
        `children under 7 carried`                      IS `the children`

`a normal load` MEANS `carrying` 100 `, with persons` 2 `, and children under 7` 0

-- The general event builder.
GIVEN `the date`       IS A DATE
      `the peril`      IS A `A peril`
      `sudden`         IS A BOOLEAN
      `the place`      IS A `Where the loss happened`
      `war`            IS A BOOLEAN
      `who`            IS A LIST OF `Someone who acted deliberately`
      `hired out`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `the inspection` IS A `The inspection status at the time of the loss`
      `the load`       IS A `The load at the time of the loss`
      `the parts`      IS A LIST OF `A damaged part`
      `the paint`      IS A MAYBE `The paint damage`
      `police`         IS A BOOLEAN
      `earlier thefts` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `The event`
`an event on` `the date` `: peril` `the peril` `, sudden` `sudden` `, at` `the place` `, war` `war` `, deliberate` `who` `, hired out` `hired out` `, inspection` `the inspection` `, load` `the load` `, parts` `the parts` `, paint` `the paint` `, police suspension` `police` `, earlier part thefts` `earlier thefts` MEANS
    `The event` WITH
        `the date of the loss`                                     IS `the date`
        `what happened`                                            IS `the peril`
        `sudden and unforeseeable`                                 IS `sudden`
        `where it happened`                                        IS `the place`
        `in war or terrorism`                                      IS `war`
        `who acted deliberately to cause the damage`               IS `who`
        `the vehicle was hired out, lent, held for a debt, or under dispute` IS `hired out`
        `the inspection status`                                    IS `the inspection`
        `the load`                                                 IS `the load`
        `the damaged parts`                                        IS `the parts`
        `the paint damage`                                         IS `the paint`
        `market value at the time and place of the loss`           IS 580_000_000
        `the police suspended the investigation or the prosecution` IS `police`
        `the stolen vehicle was found after the compensation was paid` IS FALSE
        `earlier thefts of parts compensated under BVVC04`         IS `earlier thefts`

-- A sudden event in Vietnam on 15 June 2026, nothing unusual about it but the peril and the parts.
GIVEN `the peril` IS A `A peril`
      `the parts` IS A LIST OF `A damaged part`
GIVETH AN `The event`
`a sudden` `the peril` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` `the parts` MEANS
    `an event on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `: peril` `the peril` `, sudden` TRUE `, at` `in Vietnam` `, war` FALSE `, deliberate` EMPTY
        `, hired out` FALSE `, inspection` `a valid inspection certificate` `, load` `a normal load` `, parts` `the parts`
        `, paint` NOTHING `, police suspension` FALSE `, earlier part thefts` 0

GIVEN `the peril` IS A `A peril`
      `the date`  IS A DATE
      `the parts` IS A LIST OF `A damaged part`
GIVETH AN `The event`
`a sudden` `the peril` `on` `the date` `, damaging` `the parts` MEANS
    `an event on` `the date` `: peril` `the peril` `, sudden` TRUE `, at` `in Vietnam` `, war` FALSE `, deliberate` EMPTY
        `, hired out` FALSE `, inspection` `a valid inspection certificate` `, load` `a normal load` `, parts` `the parts`
        `, paint` NOTHING `, police suspension` FALSE `, earlier part thefts` 0

`the standard collision` MEANS `a sudden` `a collision` `on 15 June 2026, damaging` `the standard parts`

§§ `The driving`

`a sober licensed driver with consent` MEANS `The person driving` WITH
    `drove with the consent of the purchaser or the insured`        IS TRUE
    `held a driving licence`                                        IS TRUE
    `the licence had expired`                                       IS FALSE
    `the licence was right for the class of vehicle`                IS TRUE
    `the right to use the licence had been withdrawn`               IS FALSE
    `a learner driving a training vehicle`                          IS FALSE
    `a candidate driving a test vehicle in a driving examination`   IS FALSE
    `blood alcohol, milligrams per 100 millilitres`                 IS NOTHING
    `breath alcohol, milligrams per litre`                          IS NOTHING
    `had used narcotics or stimulants the law prohibits`            IS FALSE
    `did not let the authorities measure alcohol in blood or breath` IS FALSE

GIVEN `consent`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `licence`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `expired`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `right`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `withdrawn` IS A BOOLEAN
      `learner`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `blood`     IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `breath`    IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `drugs`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `refused`   IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `The person driving`
`a person driving: consent` `consent` `, licence` `licence` `, expired` `expired` `, right class` `right` `, withdrawn` `withdrawn` `, learner` `learner` `, blood` `blood` `, breath` `breath` `, drugs` `drugs` `, refused a test` `refused` MEANS
    `The person driving` WITH
        `drove with the consent of the purchaser or the insured`        IS `consent`
        `held a driving licence`                                        IS `licence`
        `the licence had expired`                                       IS `expired`
        `the licence was right for the class of vehicle`                IS `right`
        `the right to use the licence had been withdrawn`               IS `withdrawn`
        `a learner driving a training vehicle`                          IS `learner`
        `a candidate driving a test vehicle in a driving examination`   IS FALSE
        `blood alcohol, milligrams per 100 millilitres`                 IS `blood`
        `breath alcohol, milligrams per litre`                          IS `breath`
        `had used narcotics or stimulants the law prohibits`            IS `drugs`
        `did not let the authorities measure alcohol in blood or breath` IS `refused`

`careful driving` MEANS `The manner of driving` WITH
    `drove the wrong way`                                              IS FALSE
    `turned or made a U-turn where that is prohibited`                 IS FALSE
    `disobeyed traffic signals`                                        IS FALSE
    `drove at night without lights, or without lights on as the law requires` IS FALSE
    `racing, lawful or unlawful`                                       IS FALSE
    `towing another vehicle in breach of the law`                      IS FALSE
    `carrying dangerous goods without the permit the law requires`     IS FALSE
    `stopped where a no-stopping-and-no-parking sign is posted`        IS FALSE
    `parked where a no-parking or no-stopping-and-no-parking sign is posted` IS FALSE
    `drove into a lane reserved for buses or trams`                    IS FALSE
    `drove into a road whose signs bar that type of vehicle`           IS FALSE
    `excess over the speed limit found in writing by the authorities`  IS NOTHING

GIVEN `wrong way`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `signals`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `racing`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `dangerous`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `parked`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `speed`       IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `The manner of driving`
`driving: wrong way` `wrong way` `, disobeyed signals` `signals` `, racing` `racing` `, dangerous goods` `dangerous` `, parked at a no-parking sign` `parked` `, speed excess` `speed` MEANS
    `The manner of driving` WITH
        `drove the wrong way`                                              IS `wrong way`
        `turned or made a U-turn where that is prohibited`                 IS FALSE
        `disobeyed traffic signals`                                        IS `signals`
        `drove at night without lights, or without lights on as the law requires` IS FALSE
        `racing, lawful or unlawful`                                       IS `racing`
        `towing another vehicle in breach of the law`                      IS FALSE
        `carrying dangerous goods without the permit the law requires`     IS `dangerous`
        `stopped where a no-stopping-and-no-parking sign is posted`        IS FALSE
        `parked where a no-parking or no-stopping-and-no-parking sign is posted` IS `parked`
        `drove into a lane reserved for buses or trams`                    IS FALSE
        `drove into a road whose signs bar that type of vehicle`           IS FALSE
        `excess over the speed limit found in writing by the authorities`  IS `speed`

`the standard driving` MEANS `The driving` WITH
    `the person driving`    IS JUST `a sober licensed driver with consent`
    `the manner of driving` IS `careful driving`

`nobody driving` MEANS `The driving` WITH
    `the person driving`    IS NOTHING
    `the manner of driving` IS `careful driving`

GIVEN `the person` IS A `The person driving`
      `the manner` IS A `The manner of driving`
GIVETH A `The driving`
`driven by` `the person` `,` `the manner` MEANS
    `The driving` WITH
        `the person driving`    IS JUST `the person`
        `the manner of driving` IS `the manner`

§§ `After the loss`

`prompt and proper conduct` MEANS `The conduct after the loss` WITH
    `hours until the insurer was told`                                   IS JUST 1
    `days until written notice of the damage was sent`                   IS JUST 2
    `force majeure prevented the written notice`                         IS FALSE
    `the insurer assessed the damage within five days`                   IS FALSE
    `hours until the police and the insurer were told of a theft`        IS NOTHING
    `took every measure to rescue and to limit harm to people and property` IS TRUE
    `kept the scene as it was`                                           IS TRUE
    `moved the vehicle from the scene without the insurer's consent`     IS FALSE
    `the move was for safety or on the authorities' orders`              IS FALSE
    `dismantled or repaired the property without the insurer's consent`  IS FALSE
    `the dismantling or repair was needed for safety, to limit harm, or ordered by the authorities` IS FALSE
    `failed to preserve or transfer the right of recovery against a third party, did not cooperate in recovering, or settled with the third party alone` IS FALSE
    `dishonest in the information or documents of the claim`            IS FALSE
    `did not facilitate the insurer's verification of the claim documents` IS FALSE
    `the reduction the insurer fixed under 15.1.3`                       IS NOTHING

GIVEN `hours`         IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `days`          IS A MAYBE NUMBER
      `force majeure` IS A BOOLEAN
      `moved`         IS A BOOLEAN
      `for safety`    IS A BOOLEAN
      `repaired`      IS A BOOLEAN
      `dishonest`     IS A BOOLEAN
      `the rate`      IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `The conduct after the loss`
`conduct: told after hours` `hours` `, written notice after days` `days` `, force majeure` `force majeure` `, moved without consent` `moved` `, for safety` `for safety` `, repaired without consent` `repaired` `, dishonest` `dishonest` `, 15.1.3 rate` `the rate` MEANS
    `The conduct after the loss` WITH
        `hours until the insurer was told`                                   IS `hours`
        `days until written notice of the damage was sent`                   IS `days`
        `force majeure prevented the written notice`                         IS `force majeure`
        `the insurer assessed the damage within five days`                   IS FALSE
        `hours until the police and the insurer were told of a theft`        IS `hours`
        `took every measure to rescue and to limit harm to people and property` IS TRUE
        `kept the scene as it was`                                           IS NOT `moved`
        `moved the vehicle from the scene without the insurer's consent`     IS `moved`
        `the move was for safety or on the authorities' orders`              IS `for safety`
        `dismantled or repaired the property without the insurer's consent`  IS `repaired`
        `the dismantling or repair was needed for safety, to limit harm, or ordered by the authorities` IS `for safety`
        `failed to preserve or transfer the right of recovery against a third party, did not cooperate in recovering, or settled with the third party alone` IS FALSE
        `dishonest in the information or documents of the claim`            IS `dishonest`
        `did not facilitate the insurer's verification of the claim documents` IS FALSE
        `the reduction the insurer fixed under 15.1.3`                       IS `the rate`

`no premium shortfall` MEANS `The premium shortfall` WITH
    `the purchaser misdeclared the purpose of use, so too little premium was collected` IS FALSE
    `the risk increased and the insurer was not told, so too little premium was collected` IS FALSE
    `the premium actually paid`                                          IS 3_650_000
    `the premium that should have been paid`                             IS NOTHING

GIVEN `misdeclared` IS A BOOLEAN
      `not told`    IS A BOOLEAN
      `paid`        IS A NUMBER
      `due`         IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A `The premium shortfall`
`a shortfall: misdeclared` `misdeclared` `, risk increase not told` `not told` `, paid` `paid` `, due` `due` MEANS
    `The premium shortfall` WITH
        `the purchaser misdeclared the purpose of use, so too little premium was collected` IS `misdeclared`
        `the risk increased and the insurer was not told, so too little premium was collected` IS `not told`
        `the premium actually paid`                                          IS `paid`
        `the premium that should have been paid`                             IS `due`

`no costs` MEANS `The expenses` WITH
    `incurred at the insurer's request and on its direction`   IS FALSE
    `cost of preventing further damage`                        IS 0
    `cost of rescue and of transport to the nearest repairer`  IS 0

GIVEN `requested`   IS A BOOLEAN
      `prevention`  IS A NUMBER
      `towing`      IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The expenses`
`costs: at the insurer's request` `requested` `, preventing further damage` `prevention` `, rescue and towing` `towing` MEANS
    `The expenses` WITH
        `incurred at the insurer's request and on its direction`   IS `requested`
        `cost of preventing further damage`                        IS `prevention`
        `cost of rescue and of transport to the nearest repairer`  IS `towing`

`no wreck kept` MEANS `The salvage` WITH
    `the insured asks to keep the vehicle after a total loss`  IS FALSE
    `the salvage value as the insurer values it`               IS NOTHING

GIVEN `the daily costs` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE `The car hire during repair`
`car hire costing` `the daily costs` MEANS
    JUST (`The car hire during repair` WITH
        `daily costs of taxis or a hired car`                       IS `the daily costs`
        `supported by the receipts and VAT invoices BVVC05 asks for` IS TRUE)

§§ `Claims`

-- The general claim builder: every part supplied.
GIVEN `the vehicle`   IS A `The insured vehicle`
      `the policy`    IS A `The policy`
      `the claimant`  IS A `The claimant`
      `the event`     IS A `The event`
      `the driving`   IS A `The driving`
      `the conduct`   IS A `The conduct after the loss`
      `the shortfall` IS A `The premium shortfall`
      `the costs`     IS A `The expenses`
      `the hire`      IS A MAYBE `The car hire during repair`
      `the salvage`   IS A `The salvage`
      `the others`    IS A LIST OF `Another insurance of the vehicle`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a claim: vehicle` `the vehicle` `, policy` `the policy` `, claimant` `the claimant` `, event` `the event` `, driving` `the driving` `, conduct` `the conduct` `, shortfall` `the shortfall` `, costs` `the costs` `, hire` `the hire` `, wreck` `the salvage` `, other insurance` `the others` MEANS
    `A claim` WITH
        `the vehicle`                     IS `the vehicle`
        `the policy`                      IS `the policy`
        `the claimant`                    IS `the claimant`
        `the event`                       IS `the event`
        `the driving`                     IS `the driving`
        `the conduct after the loss`      IS `the conduct`
        `the premium shortfall`           IS `the shortfall`
        `the expenses`                    IS `the costs`
        `the car hire`                    IS `the hire`
        `the salvage`                     IS `the salvage`
        `other insurance of the vehicle`  IS `the others`

-- The standard case, varying the policy, the event and the driving.
GIVEN `the policy`  IS A `The policy`
      `the event`   IS A `The event`
      `the driving` IS A `The driving`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a standard claim under` `the policy` `for` `the event` `,` `the driving` MEANS
    `a claim: vehicle` `the standard vehicle` `, policy` `the policy` `, claimant` `the insured named on the certificate`
        `, event` `the event` `, driving` `the driving` `, conduct` `prompt and proper conduct`
        `, shortfall` `no premium shortfall` `, costs` `no costs` `, hire` NOTHING `, wreck` `no wreck kept` `, other insurance` EMPTY

GIVEN `the event` IS A `The event`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a standard claim for` `the event` MEANS
    `a standard claim under` `the standard policy` `for` `the event` `,` `the standard driving`

GIVEN `the conduct` IS A `The conduct after the loss`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`the standard collision, with conduct` `the conduct` MEANS
    `a claim: vehicle` `the standard vehicle` `, policy` `the standard policy` `, claimant` `the insured named on the certificate`
        `, event` `the standard collision` `, driving` `the standard driving` `, conduct` `the conduct`
        `, shortfall` `no premium shortfall` `, costs` `no costs` `, hire` NOTHING `, wreck` `no wreck kept` `, other insurance` EMPTY

`the standard claim` MEANS `a standard claim for` `the standard collision`
